---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的页面不存在。返回徐苏洋个人成果站首页或项目归档。">
  <section class="not-found container">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">HTTP 404</p>
      <h1>这一页<br /><span class="accent">没有记录。</span></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="not-found-copy">
      <p>链接可能已经变更，或项目仍在整理中。你可以返回首页，或继续浏览完整项目归档。</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/projects/">浏览项目</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: grid;
    min-height: calc(100dvh - 68px);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(18rem, 0.7fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 9ch;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  h1 .accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .not-found-copy {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .not-found {
      min-height: auto;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
